{"meta":{"id":"async-await","category":"it/syntax/typescript/network","title":"async / await · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"비동기 작업을 순차적으로 처리 — try/catch, Promise<T> 반환 타입","tags":["typescript","f-network","f-async"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">async / await · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 비동기 작업을 순차적으로 처리 — try/catch, Promise&lt;T&gt; 반환 타입</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">async / await — 비동기 작업을 순차적으로 처리</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">async function loadDashboard(userId: number) {\r\n  try {\r\n    const user = await getUser(userId);          // 1. 끝날 때까지 기다림\r\n    const orders = await getOrders(user.id);     // 2. user 결과를 사용\r\n    return { user, orders };\r\n  } catch (e) {\r\n    console.error(&quot;불러오기 실패&quot;, e);\r\n    throw e;\r\n  } finally {\r\n    hideLoading();\r\n  }\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>async</code> 함수는 항상 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Promise</code> 를 반환한다. <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>await</code> 는 Promise 가 끝날 때까지 기다리고 결과값을 꺼낸다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">반환 타입</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">async function getCount(): Promise&lt;number&gt; {\r\n  return 10;           // Promise&lt;number&gt; 로 감싸짐\r\n}\r\nconst n = await getCount();   // number</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">주의</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서로 관계없는 요청을 await 로 하나씩 기다리면 느려진다 → Promise.all 로 병렬 처리</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>forEach</code> 안의 await 는 기다리지 않는다 → <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>for … of</code> 사용</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 통신 › Promise.all</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network/async-await","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network"}],"hasImage":false}